# Paths a daemon rewrites on its own schedule — see compound-ops/tools/deploy-dirty.sh.
# One extended-regex per line, matched against the `git status --porcelain` path. A tree
# whose ONLY dirty paths are listed here is not "somebody stopped mid-edit", so it still
# deploys. Everything here fails OPEN — a wrong entry lets a deploy ship a real unfinished
# edit — so only list paths a NAMED generator writes unattended.
# npx opennextjs-cloudflare build — declared by nightly-deploy 2026-10-01
^\.open-next(?:/.*)?$
# npx wrangler dev or the OpenNext preview command — declared by nightly-deploy 2026-10-01
^\.wrangler(?:/.*)?$
